  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[3,1,0] run** (same code, first cell switched to `Λ = {3, 1, 0}`):\n\n| Λ, d1, d2, nilp | {{3, 1, 0}, 15, 225, 3} |\n|---|---|\n| distinct total weights, distinct one-site weights | {36, 12} |\n| diag G | {1, 1, 2, 3, 24, 32, 4, 12, 24, 64, 288, 576, 36, 128, 576} |\n| pr, θ, θ12 | {200, {2/7, -3/5}, 31/35} |\n| JJ gl(3) relations | True |\n| G unique, positive, invariant for all Ee[i,j] | True |\n| nilpotency: Ee[i,j]^(nilp+1) = 0 (i != j), Ee[1,3]^nilp != 0 | True |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 0. cdet(dd - L_g) = dd^3 - S1 dd^2 + S2 dd - S3, normal-ordered ONCE on 27 noncommuting symbols l[i,j], lp[i,j] (= l'), lpp[i,j] (= l''), with the formal derivative dd moved to the right by dd.f = f.dd + f'. A term is {coefficient, word, k} meaning coefficient * word.dd^k, word = list of symbols in product order; dd^k.l = Sum_j Binomial[k,j] l^(j).dd^(k-j). The column determinant is Sum_sigma sgn(sigma) M[sigma(1),1] M[sigma(2),2] M[sigma(3),3], M = dd 1 - L. *)\nck = <||>;\ndsym[l[a_, b_], 0] := l[a, b]; dsym[l[a_, b_], 1] := lp[a, b]; dsym[l[a_, b_], 2] := lpp[a, b]; dsym[l[a_, b_], 3] := lppp[a, b];\nmulRight[terms_, fac_] := If[fac === \"dd\", Map[{#[[1]], #[[2]], #[[3]] + 1} &, terms], Flatten[Map[Function[t, Table[{-t[[1]] Binomial[t[[3]], j], Append[t[[2]], dsym[fac, j]], t[[3]] - j}, {j, 0, t[[3]]}]], terms], 1]];\ncolEntryChoices[r_, c_] := If[r == c, {\"dd\", l[r, c]}, {l[r, c]}];\ntermsOfSigma[sg_] := Module[{ts = {{Signature[sg], {}, 0}}},\n  Do[ts = Flatten[Table[mulRight[ts, ch], {ch, colEntryChoices[sg[[c]], c]}], 1], {c, 3}]; ts];\nallTerms = Flatten[termsOfSigma /@ Permutations[Range[3]], 1];\ncollected = KeyValueMap[Function[{key, v}, {Total[v[[All, 1]]], key[[1]], key[[2]]}], GroupBy[allTerms, {#[[2]], #[[3]]} &]];\ncollected = Select[collected, #[[1]] =!= 0 &];\ntermsAtK[k_] := Select[collected, #[[3]] == k &];\n(* S1 = -coef(dd^2), S2 = +coef(dd), S3 = -coef(dd^0) *)\nSsym = <|1 -> ({-#[[1]], #[[2]]} & /@ termsAtK[2]), 2 -> ({#[[1]], #[[2]]} & /@ termsAtK[1]), 3 -> ({-#[[1]], #[[2]]} & /@ termsAtK[0])|>;\nck[\"dd^3 coefficient is exactly 1 (word empty)\"] = termsAtK[3] === {{1, {}, 3}};\nck[\"no third derivatives lppp appear\"] = FreeQ[Ssym, lppp];\nwordForm[w_] := Which[w === {}, 1, Length[w] == 1, w[[1]], True, NonCommutativeMultiply @@ w];\nsymForm[k_] := Plus @@ (#[[1]] wordForm[#[[2]]] & /@ Ssym[k]);\nS2symStr = symForm[2]; S3symStr = symForm[3];\n(* S2 minus the naive quadratic part Sum_{i<j}(l_ii l_jj - l_ji l_ij): what remains must be derivative terms only *)\nnaiveS2 = Plus @@ Flatten[Table[l[i, i] ** l[j, j] - l[j, i] ** l[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, i + 1, 3}]];\nS2minusNaive = symForm[2] - naiveS2;\nck[\"S2 - naive quadratic part is linear in lp (derivative terms) only\"] = FreeQ[S2minusNaive, l] && ! FreeQ[S2minusNaive, lp];\n(* numeric side: Lax matrices at rational u (sparse), derivatives exact *)\nLm[g_, ths_, u_] := Lm[g, ths, u] = Association[Flatten[Table[{l[i, j] -> g[[i, j]] id2 + E1[i, j]/(u - ths[[1]]) + E2[i, j]/(u - ths[[2]]), lp[i, j] -> -E1[i, j]/(u - ths[[1]])^2 - E2[i, j]/(u - ths[[2]])^2, lpp[i, j] -> 2 E1[i, j]/(u - ths[[1]])^3 + 2 E2[i, j]/(u - ths[[2]])^3}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1]];\nevalWord[w_, M_] := If[w === {}, id2, Dot @@ Map[M[#] &, w]];\nSk[k_][g_, ths_, u_] := Sk[k][g, ths, u] = Module[{M = Lm[g, ths, u]}, Total[Table[t[[1]] evalWord[t[[2]], M], {t, Ssym[k]}]]];\ngZ = DiagonalMatrix[zP];\n{tS3one, S3test} = AbsoluteTiming[Sk[3][gZ, thN, u0]];\nzeroQ[a_] := Union[Flatten[Normal[a]]] === {0};\ncmt[a_, b_] := a . b - b . a;\nck[\"S1 = (sum zeta + |Lambda| sum_s 1/(u-theta_s)) id exactly\"] = Table[Sk[1][gZ, thN, u] === (Total[zP] + lamTot (1/(u - thN[[1]]) + 1/(u - thN[[2]]))) id2, {u, {u0, u1, u2}}];\ncm = {{2, 2, u0, u1}, {2, 3, u0, u1}, {3, 3, u0, u1}, {2, 2, u1, u2}, {2, 3, u1, u2}, {3, 3, u1, u2}, {3, 2, u0, u2}};\nck[\"[S_a(u), S_b(v)] = 0 exactly (7 pairs)\"] = Table[zeroQ[cmt[Sk[c[[1]]][gZ, thN, c[[3]]], Sk[c[[2]]][gZ, thN, c[[4]]]]], {c, cm}];\nck[\"S1 commutes with S2, S3 (exact)\"] = {cmt[Sk[2][gZ, thN, u0], Sk[1][gZ, thN, u1]] // zeroQ, cmt[Sk[3][gZ, thN, u0], Sk[1][gZ, thN, u1]] // zeroQ};\nWtot[k_] := E1[k, k] + E2[k, k];\nck[\"S2, S3 conserve the weight for diagonal g (commute with total E_kk, k = 1,2,3)\"] = Table[zeroQ[cmt[Sk[a][gZ, thN, u0], Wtot[k]]], {a, {2, 3}}, {k, 3}];\nck[\"time of one S3(u) (s), all exact\"] = tS3one;\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"S2 (symbolic, noncommutative)\", ToString[S2symStr, InputForm]}, {\"S3 (symbolic, noncommutative)\", ToString[S3symStr, InputForm]}, {\"S2 - sum_{i<j}(l_ii l_jj - l_ji l_ij)\", ToString[S2minusNaive, InputForm]}, {\"# terms in S2, S3\", {Length[Ssym[2]], Length[Ssym[3]]}}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[2,1,0] run** (the saved value of the switch):\n\n| S2 (symbolic, noncommutative) | -lp[2, 2] - 2*lp[3, 3] + l[1, 1]**l[2, 2] + l[1, 1]**l[3, 3] - l[2, 1]**l[1, 2] + l[2, 2]**l[3, 3] - l[3, 1]**l[1, 3] - l[3, 2]**l[2, 3] |\n|---|---|\n| S3 (symbolic, noncommutative) | lpp[3, 3] - l[1, 1]**lp[3, 3] - l[2, 2]**lp[3, 3] + l[3, 1]**lp[1, 3] + l[3, 2]**lp[2, 3] - lp[2, 2]**l[3, 3] + lp[3, 2]**l[2, 3] + l[1, 1]**l[2, 2]**l[3, 3] - l[1, 1]**l[3, 2]**l[2, 3] - l[2, 1]**l[1, 2]**l[3, 3] + l[2, 1]**l[3, 2]**l[1, 3] + l[3, 1]**l[1, 2]**l[2, 3] - l[3, 1]**l[2, 2]**l[1, 3] |\n| S2 - sum_{i<j}(l_ii l_jj - l_ji l_ij) | -lp[2, 2] - 2*lp[3, 3] |\n| # terms in S2, S3 | {8, 13} |\n| dd^3 coefficient is exactly 1 (word empty) | True |\n| no third derivatives lppp appear | True |\n| S2 - naive quadratic part is linear in lp (derivative terms) only | True |\n| S1 = (sum zeta + \\|Lambda\\| sum_s 1/(u-theta_s)) id exactly | {True, True, True} |\n| [S_a(u), S_b(v)] = 0 exactly (7 pairs) | {True, True, True, True, True, True, True} |\n| S1 commutes with S2, S3 (exact) | {True, True} |\n| S2, S3 conserve the weight for diagonal g (commute with total E_kk, k = 1,2,3) | {{True, True, True}, {True, True, True}} |\n| time of one S3(u) (s), all exact | 0.0052244 |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[3,1,0] run** (same code, first cell switched to `Λ = {3, 1, 0}`):\n\n| S2 (symbolic, noncommutative) | -lp[2, 2] - 2*lp[3, 3] + l[1, 1]**l[2, 2] + l[1, 1]**l[3, 3] - l[2, 1]**l[1, 2] + l[2, 2]**l[3, 3] - l[3, 1]**l[1, 3] - l[3, 2]**l[2, 3] |\n|---|---|\n| S3 (symbolic, noncommutative) | lpp[3, 3] - l[1, 1]**lp[3, 3] - l[2, 2]**lp[3, 3] + l[3, 1]**lp[1, 3] + l[3, 2]**lp[2, 3] - lp[2, 2]**l[3, 3] + lp[3, 2]**l[2, 3] + l[1, 1]**l[2, 2]**l[3, 3] - l[1, 1]**l[3, 2]**l[2, 3] - l[2, 1]**l[1, 2]**l[3, 3] + l[2, 1]**l[3, 2]**l[1, 3] + l[3, 1]**l[1, 2]**l[2, 3] - l[3, 1]**l[2, 2]**l[1, 3] |\n| S2 - sum_{i<j}(l_ii l_jj - l_ji l_ij) | -lp[2, 2] - 2*lp[3, 3] |\n| # terms in S2, S3 | {8, 13} |\n| dd^3 coefficient is exactly 1 (word empty) | True |\n| no third derivatives lppp appear | True |\n| S2 - naive quadratic part is linear in lp (derivative terms) only | True |\n| S1 = (sum zeta + \\|Lambda\\| sum_s 1/(u-theta_s)) id exactly | {True, True, True} |\n| [S_a(u), S_b(v)] = 0 exactly (7 pairs) | {True, True, True, True, True, True, True} |\n| S1 commutes with S2, S3 (exact) | {True, True} |\n| S2, S3 conserve the weight for diagonal g (commute with total E_kk, k = 1,2,3) | {{True, True, True}, {True, True, True}} |\n| time of one S3(u) (s), all exact | 0.0176659 |",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 0 (cont). The Laurent coefficients of S2, S3 in u: the \"Gaudin T's\". S2 = c0 + Sum_s [a_s/(u-th_s) + b_s/(u-th_s)^2], S3 = c0 + Sum_s Sum_{k=1..3} c_{s,k}/(u-th_s)^k, fitted EXACTLY from rational u samples (sparse matrix coefficients) and verified at further sample points. laurent[g, ths] is memoized on its exact arguments (re-run this cell after any change to Sk). *)\nck = <||>;\nuSam = {3/7, -2/9, 5/11, 1/3, -4/5, 6/7, 7/3, 9/5, -3/2};\nbas2[ths_, u_] := {1, 1/(u - ths[[1]]), 1/(u - ths[[1]])^2, 1/(u - ths[[2]]), 1/(u - ths[[2]])^2};\nbas3[ths_, u_] := {1, 1/(u - ths[[1]]), 1/(u - ths[[1]])^2, 1/(u - ths[[1]])^3, 1/(u - ths[[2]]), 1/(u - ths[[2]])^2, 1/(u - ths[[2]])^3};\nfitLaurent[kk_, bas_, g_, ths_] := Module[{nb = Length[bas[ths, 1]], pts, Ainv, cs, resid},\n  pts = Take[uSam, nb]; Ainv = Inverse[Table[bas[ths, p], {p, pts}]];\n  cs = Table[Total[Table[Ainv[[j, k]] Sk[kk][g, ths, pts[[k]]], {k, nb}]], {j, nb}];\n  resid = Table[Total[Table[bas[ths, p][[j]] cs[[j]], {j, nb}]] - Sk[kk][g, ths, p], {p, Drop[uSam, nb]}];\n  {cs, resid}];\nlaurent[g_, ths_] := laurent[g, ths] = Module[{f2, f3, S3inf},\n  f2 = fitLaurent[2, bas2, g, ths]; f3 = fitLaurent[3, bas3, g, ths];\n  <|\"S2inf\" -> f2[[1, 1]], \"Hres\" -> {f2[[1, 2]], f2[[1, 4]]}, \"S2dbl\" -> {f2[[1, 3]], f2[[1, 5]]}, \"S3inf\" -> f3[[1, 1]], \"S3c\" -> <|{1, 1} -> f3[[1, 2]], {1, 2} -> f3[[1, 3]], {1, 3} -> f3[[1, 4]], {2, 1} -> f3[[1, 5]], {2, 2} -> f3[[1, 6]], {2, 3} -> f3[[1, 7]]|>,\n   \"resid2\" -> f2[[2]], \"resid3\" -> f3[[2]]|>];\nzeroQ[a_] := Union[Flatten[Normal[a]]] === {0};\nscalarQ[a_] := With[{A = Normal[a]}, zeroQ[A - A[[1, 1]] id2]];\n{tLaur, LA} = AbsoluteTiming[laurent[gZ, thN]];\nck[\"Laurent ansatz verified at extra points: S2 (4 pts), S3 (2 pts), exact\"] = {And @@ (zeroQ /@ LA[\"resid2\"]), And @@ (zeroQ /@ LA[\"resid3\"])};\nck[\"S3c[s,3] (s=1,2), S3inf, S2inf, S2dbl[s] are scalars\"] = {scalarQ[LA[\"S3c\"][{1, 3}]], scalarQ[LA[\"S3c\"][{2, 3}]], scalarQ[LA[\"S3inf\"]], scalarQ[LA[\"S2inf\"]], scalarQ[LA[\"S2dbl\"][[1]]], scalarQ[LA[\"S2dbl\"][[2]]]};\nWop = zP[[1]] (E1[1, 1] + E2[1, 1]) + zP[[2]] (E1[2, 2] + E2[2, 2]) + zP[[3]] (E1[3, 3] + E2[3, 3]);\nsumH = LA[\"Hres\"][[1]] + LA[\"Hres\"][[2]];\nck[\"Hres1 + Hres2 = +W + scalar ?  / = -W + scalar ?  (W = Sum_k zeta_k (E_tot)_kk)\"] = {scalarQ[sumH - Wop], scalarQ[sumH + Wop]};\nHform = Sum[zP[[i]] E1[i, i], {i, 3}] + Sum[E1[i, k] . E2[k, i], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]/th12;\n(* hand derivation from S2 = Sum_{i<j}(l_ii l_jj - l_ji l_ij) - l'_22 - 2 l'_33 (diagonal g): Res_{th1} S2 = -Sum_i g_i E1_ii - Sum_ij E1_ij E2_ji/th12 + (Sum g |Lambda| + |Lambda|^2/th12) id, i.e. MINUS the form expected in the plan (the dd - L convention); tested exactly *)\nHexact = -Hform + (Total[zP] lamTot + lamTot^2/th12) id2;\nck[\"H1 = Res_th1 S2 = -[Sum_i zeta_i E1_ii + Sum_ik E1_ik E2_ki/th12] + (Sum zeta |Lambda| + |Lambda|^2/th12) id (exact)\"] = zeroQ[LA[\"Hres\"][[1]] - Hexact];\nck[\"H1 + H2 + W = scalar = 2 |Lambda| Sum zeta exactly: {value, equal}\"] = With[{sc = Normal[sumH + Wop][[1, 1]]}, {sc, sc === 2 lamTot Total[zP]}];\nck[\"H2 = Res_th2 S2 = -Sum zeta_i E2_ii + Sum E1_ij E2_ji/th12 + (Sum zeta |Lambda| - |Lambda|^2/th12) id (exact)\"] = zeroQ[LA[\"Hres\"][[2]] - (-Sum[zP[[i]] E2[i, i], {i, 3}] + Sum[E1[i, k] . E2[k, i], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]/th12 + (Total[zP] lamTot - lamTot^2/th12) id2)];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s): Laurent fit S2 + S3\", tLaur}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
