   "value": "**[3,1,0] run** (same code, first cell switched to `Λ = {3, 1, 0}`):\n\n| time (s): Laurent fit S2 + S3 | 0.4056067 |\n|---|---|\n| Laurent ansatz verified at extra points: S2 (4 pts), S3 (2 pts), exact | {True, True} |\n| S3c[s,3] (s=1,2), S3inf, S2inf, S2dbl[s] are scalars | {True, True, True, True, True, True} |\n| Hres1 + Hres2 = +W + scalar ?  / = -W + scalar ?  (W = Sum_k zeta_k (E_tot)_kk) | {False, True} |\n| H1 = Res_th1 S2 = -[Sum_i zeta_i E1_ii + Sum_ik E1_ik E2_ki/th12] + (Sum zeta \\|Lambda\\| + \\|Lambda\\|^2/th12) id (exact) | True |\n| H1 + H2 + W = scalar = 2 \\|Lambda\\| Sum zeta exactly: {value, equal} | {82/3, True} |\n| H2 = Res_th2 S2 = -Sum zeta_i E2_ii + Sum E1_ij E2_ji/th12 + (Sum zeta \\|Lambda\\| - \\|Lambda\\|^2/th12) id (exact) | True |",
