  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[3,1,0] run** (same code, first cell switched to `Λ = {3, 1, 0}`):\n\n| time (s), eigencovector tests | 1.3468974 |\n|---|---|\n| PauxG gc PauxG^-1 = diag(zeta) (exact, P and P') | {True, True} |\n| Omega(x)Omega left eigencovector of {S2(u0), S3(u0), S2(u1), S3(u1)}: variants V1..V5 (V5 = diag(omega) control), at P, P', regime pt | {{\"P\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}, {\"P'\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}, {\"regime eps=1e-6, dir (phi, (3/4,-1/5))\", {{True, True, True, True}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}, {False, False, False, False}}}} |\n| one-site (variant V1, P and P'): {M g' M^-1 = diag(omega), {for X = M, M^-1, M^T, M^-T: {e1 rho(U_X) parallel to OmegaD, equal}}} | {{True, {{False, False}, {False, False}, {False, False}, {True, True}}}, {True, {{False, False}, {False, False}, {False, False}, {True, True}}}} |\n| Pphys3[zeta] vs PauxG: = PauxG^-1 up to row/column scaling? ranks of ratio; exact equalities {Pphys3 == PauxG^-1, Pphys3 == Transpose[PauxG^-1], Pphys3 == PauxG, Pphys3 == Transpose[PauxG]} | {False, True, False, False} |\n| x0G = x0Of[zeta] at P: nonzero, number of nonzero components of 64 | {225, 225} |\n| ΩD[eps phi, eps omega] == ΩD[phi, omega] exactly (eps = 10^-6, 3, 1/7; 4 grid points) | {{True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}} |\n| undone covector phiUof[eps phi, eps om, eps om'] == phiUof[phi, om, om'] exactly | {{True, True, True, True}, {True, True, True, True}} |",
