   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[3,1,0] run** (same code, first cell switched to `Λ = {3, 1, 0}`):\n\n| # HW kets, # HW sectors | {10, 8} |\n|---|---|\n| annihilated by raising ops | True |\n| sectors; multiplicities; sector sizes | {{{6, 2, 0}, {6, 1, 1}, {5, 3, 0}, {5, 2, 1}, {4, 4, 0}, {4, 3, 1}, {4, 2, 2}, {3, 3, 2}}, {1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1}, {1, 2, 2, 6, 3, 10, 14, 18}} |\n| G2-projector exact | True |\n| slice weights nu = mu - Lambda and dims | {{{3, 1, 0}, 1}, {{3, 0, 1}, 1}, {{2, 2, 0}, 1}, {{2, 1, 1}, 2}, {{1, 3, 0}, 1}, {{1, 2, 1}, 2}, {{1, 1, 2}, 2}, {{0, 2, 2}, 1}} |\n| one-site weights, dims | {{{0, 1, 3}, {0, 2, 2}, {0, 3, 1}, {1, 0, 3}, {1, 1, 2}, {1, 2, 1}, {1, 3, 0}, {2, 0, 2}, {2, 1, 1}, {2, 2, 0}, {3, 0, 1}, {3, 1, 0}}, {1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1}} |",
