   "value": "**[2,1,0] run** (the saved value of the switch):\n\n| time (s): all 64 states at P, at P' | {0.0659825, 0.0933792} |\n|---|---|\n| P: # states (= d2), max eigenvector residual (S2, S3), min Precision of psi, max \\|G-norm - 1\\| | {64, 3.717823641107827*^-196, 198.47173168711652, 3.3749575360913873*^-199} |\n| P: all eigenvalues real (max \\|Im ev2\\|, \\|Im ev3\\|, relative) and pairwise distinct (S2(u0), S3(u1)) pairs: min distance | {0, 1.0326987946194547408`4.} |\n| P: x0G . Psi_B nonzero for all 64 states: min \\|x0G.Psi\\| (G-normalised states), # exactly-zero-to-precision | {0.0000318397252684224`5., 0} |\n| P': # states, max residual, all (S2,S3) pairs distinct (min distance) | {64, 5.383998866485668*^-195, 0.4381161354181015623`4.} |",
