  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[3,1,0] run** (same code, first cell switched to `Λ = {3, 1, 0}`):\n\n| time (s): all 64 states at P, at P' | {0.6346236, 0.651501} |\n|---|---|\n| P: # states (= d2), max eigenvector residual (S2, S3), min Precision of psi, max \\|G-norm - 1\\| | {225, 1.8871154929820015*^-195, 197.94179051195627, 1.1434297511892782*^-198} |\n| P: all eigenvalues real (max \\|Im ev2\\|, \\|Im ev3\\|, relative) and pairwise distinct (S2(u0), S3(u1)) pairs: min distance | {0, 0.0944578252073812607`4.} |\n| P: x0G . Psi_B nonzero for all 64 states: min \\|x0G.Psi\\| (G-normalised states), # exactly-zero-to-precision | {1.18208425292555652981483155431629`5.*^-6, 0} |\n| P': # states, max residual, all (S2,S3) pairs distinct (min distance) | {225, 4.9260983615587136*^-194, 0.758695076089909805`4.} |",
