   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[2,1,0] run** (the saved value of the switch):\n\n| time (s) all states at eps=1e-6 | 0.0739996 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| untwisted HW space invariant: A.H = H.M exactly for S2(u0), S3(u1), S3c[1,2] at g = 0, every HW sector | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| hwTrue: G-norm 1, in the HW space (raising residual), Precision min | {0``199.66925337081668, 5.523052987305852*^-200, 199.15958509143752} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| # states, # branches per eps | {{64, 6}, {64, 6}, {64, 6}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| top branch = e1 (x) e1 (max abs dev) | 2.0000001903873073*^-200 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| rr separation per sector at eps = 1e-6: {mu, max branch rr, min other rr} | {{{4, 2, 0}, 0, \"-\"}, {{4, 1, 1}, 2.3181033067840057883955815578235`3.*^-7, 1.4142135623730760502`3.}, {{3, 3, 0}, 1.9385308354977593253887818522841`3.*^-7, 1.4142135623730817626`3.}, {{3, 2, 1}, 2.1479789204987913524907658810966`3.*^-7, 2.0517347040331740082`3.}, {{2, 2, 2}, 3.454777698483`3.*^-7, 1.372961303173399276`3.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| precision of psi (min over branch states at the 3 eps) | 198.51285220884196 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| mu | copy | raising resid rr (eps=1e-6) | 1 - hwFrac | \\|\\|branch - exact\\|\\| eps=1e-6 | 2e-6 | 4e-6 | exponent (4e-6/1e-6) |\n| {4, 2, 0} | 1 | 0 | 4.0000003807746145*^-200 | 4.000000190387434*^-200 | 4.0000003807746145*^-200 | 4.0000007615492645*^-200 | - |\n| {4, 1, 1} | 1 | 2.3181033067840057883955815578235`3.*^-7 | 1.34340073523074463778281`3.*^-14 | 1.6391465677179357335804947119787`3.*^-7 | 3.278293135436`3.*^-7 | 6.556586270868`3.*^-7 | 0.9999999999996002632`4. |\n| {3, 3, 0} | 1 | 1.9385308354977593253887818522841`3.*^-7 | 9.39475450043914619720023`3.*^-15 | 1.3707482993196924770861390757052`3.*^-7 | 2.741496598639`3.*^-7 | 5.482993197276`3.*^-7 | 0.9999999999997204536`4. |\n| {3, 2, 1} | 1 | 2.1479786779039160768209516149809`3.*^-7 | 4.56082808620966889364233`3.*^-15 | 7.86037423736168526170281810994`3.*^-8 | 1.5720