  |  |\n| mu | {4, 3, 1} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| untwisted copies c=1,2 as coefficients on the exact HW kets hwKets[mu] (G-norm 1) | {{-0.01264838336837443191447891824771237207`15., -0.00248101104102891394881994128235303364`15.}, {0.00338912410911517265521965898845311281`15., -0.0345560259960081230882170957546840034`15.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| eigenvalues, eigenvectors (HW-ket coefficients) of the 2x2 matrix of S3c[1,2] at g = 0 | {{21.37055203418202648689814476809103649587`15., 5.72622215936636060987604878029606027833`15.}, {{-0.00338912410911517265521965898845311281`15., 0.0345560259960081230882170957546840034`15.}, {0.01264838336837443191447891824771237207`15., 0.00248101104102891394881994128235303364`15.}}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| \\|\\|eigvec_k - copy_c\\|\\| (k, c = 1,2; up to sign) | {{0.5314201797141386382`3., 1.6952989189153127*^-200}, {1.6019559178017604*^-200, 0.5314201797141386382`3.}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
