  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### A2: the companion-frame vacuum Omega_c[omega], its Gauss form, the frame tie to Omega_D[zeta, omega].P_phys and the scalar kappa^G\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task A2. Companion frame. Omega_c[om] := e1 rho(U-factor of PauxG[om]^-T): the one-site rule (M = rows = left eigenvectors of the companion twist gc[om], M = PauxG[om], Omega = e1 rho(U of M^-T)). (a) exact left eigencovector of the one-site cdet coefficients with L1_ij = gc[om]_ij + E_ij/(u - th1) (S2, S3 at several u and their Laurent coefficients, both theta), at three om. (b) Gauss parameters (alpha, beta, gamma) of its unipotent as rational functions of om (Factor), and the limit om2 -> infinity (beta = 0, alpha = gamma?). (c) frame tie Omega_c[om] parallel to OmegaD[zeta, om].PphysG[zeta] with PphysG = rep image of (PauxG[zeta]^-1)^T = Pphys[zeta]; kappa^G(zeta, om) = first component of OmegaD.Pphys (Omega_c has first component 1); compare with the XXX kappaTie = Prod_k Det[(n.P3)_{1..k,1..k}]^(lambda_k - lambda_{k+1}) (n = nMat3[zeta, om], P3 = PauxG^-T or its inverse); limit om2 -> infinity. *)\nck = <||>;\nΩcOf[ww_] := coverU[uOfLDU[Transpose[Inverse[PauxG[ww]]]][[1]]];\nparOf[a_, b_] := MatrixRank[{a, b}] == 1;\neigOneSite[cov_, g_, th_] := Module[{f2 = fit1[2, 2, g, th], f3 = fit1[3, 3, g, th], tests},\n  tests = Join[Table[parOf[cov, cov . Sk1[k][g, th, uu]], {k, {2, 3}}, {uu, {u0, u1, u2}}] // Flatten, Table[parOf[cov, cov . c], {c, Join[f2[[1]], f3[[1]]]}], {And @@ (zeroQ /@ f2[[2]]), And @@ (zeroQ /@ f3[[2]])}];\n  And @@ tests];\nomPts = {wP, wQ, {-3/2, 4/5, 7/3}, {5/3, -1/4, 9/7}};\nck[\"(a) Omega_c[om] exact left eigencovector of one-site S2, S3 (u0, u1, u2, all Laurent coefficients, Laurent fit exact), twist gc[om], both theta, at 4 om\"] = Table[eigOneSite[ΩcOf[ww], gc[ww], th], {ww, omPts}, {th, thN}];\nck[\"(a) control: Omega_D[zeta, om] (not companion) is NOT an eigencovector of the companion-twist one-site operators (expected False)\"] = Table[eigOneSite[ΩD[zP, ww], gc[ww], thN[[1]]], {ww, omPts[[1 ;; 2]]}];\n(* (b) Gauss parameters, symbolic *)\nomS = {o1, o2, o3};\n{Uc, s22c} = uOfLDU[Transpose[Inverse[PauxG[omS]]]];\ngaussC = Factor /@ gaussOfN[Uc];\nck[\"(b) Gauss parameters (alpha, beta, gamma) = (U12, U13 - U12 U23, U23) of the unipotent of Omega_c[om] (symbolic, Factor)\"] = ToString[gaussC, InputForm];\nck[\"(b) numeric check: coverG[gaussC at wP] == OmegaC[wP] exactly\"] = coverG[gaussC /. Thread[omS -> wP]] === ΩcOf[wP];\ngaussCinf = Factor /@ (Limit[#, o2 -> Infinity] & /@ gaussC);\nck[\"(b) om2 -> infinity limit of (alpha, beta, gamma) (om1, om3 fixed)\"] = ToString[gaussCinf, InputForm];\nck[\"(b) limit has beta = 0 and alpha = gamma (XXX gaussCov{a,0,a} pattern)?\"] = {Together[gaussCinf[[2]]] === 0, Together[gaussCinf[[1]] - gaussCinf[[3]]] === 0};\nck[\"(b) limit independent of om3?\"] = FreeQ[gaussCinf, o3];\n(* (c) frame tie *)\nPphysG[zv_] := Pphys[zv];\nck[\"PphysG[zeta] (rep image) = rho((PauxG^-1)^T): matrix Pphys3 == Transpose[Inverse[PauxG]] exactly at P, P', and a third point\"] = Table[Pphys3[zz] === Transpose[Inverse[PauxG[zz]]], {zz, {zP, zQ, {-1, 7/3, 1/2}}}];\ntieCov[zz_, ww_] := ΩD[zz, ww] . PphysG[zz];\ntiePts = {{zP, wP}, {zQ, wQ}, {zP, {-3/2, 4/5, 7/3}}, {{-1, 7/3, 1/2}, {5/3, -1/4, 9/7}}};\nck[\"(c) frame tie: OmegaD[zeta, om].PphysG[zeta] parallel to Omega_c[om] exactly, 4 points\"] = Table[parOf[tieCov[p[[1]], p[[2]]], ΩcOf[p[[2]]]], {p, tiePts}];\nkapG[zz_, ww_] := tieCov[zz, ww][[1]]/ΩcOf[ww][[1]];\nexpL = {Λ[[1]] - Λ[[2]], Λ[[2]] - Λ[[3]], Λ[[3]]};\nkapForm[zz_, ww_, P3_] := Module[{M = nMat3[zz, ww[[1]], ww[[2]]] . P3}, Product[Det[M[[1 ;; k, 1 ;; k]]]^expL[[k]], {k, 3}]];\nP3list = <|\"P3 = PauxG^-T\" -> Function[zz, Transpose[Inverse[PauxG[zz]]]], \"P3 = PauxG^T (inverse of PauxG^-T)\" -> Function[zz, Transpose[PauxG[zz]]], \"P3 = PauxG^-1\" -> Function[zz, Inverse[PauxG[zz]]], \"P3 = PauxG\" -> Function[zz, PauxG[zz]]|>;\nck[\"(c) kappa^G measured = first component of OmegaD.PphysG (Omega_c[[1]] = 1): values at 4 points\"] = Table[kapG[p[[1]], p[[2]]], {p, tiePts}];\nck[\"(c) XXX kappaTie formula Prod_k Det[(n.P3)_{1..k,1..k}]^(lambda_k - lambda_{k+1}) equals kappa^G for each P3 variant (4 points)\"] = Table[name -> Table[kapForm[p[[1]], p[[2]], P3list[name][p[[1]]]] === kapG[p[[1]], p[[2]]], {p, tiePts}], {name, Keys[P3list]}];\nkapSym = Factor[Product[Det[(nMat3[symZ, o1, o2] . Transpose[Inverse[PauxG[symZ]]])[[1 ;; k, 1 ;; k]]], {k, 3}]];\nck[\"(c) closed form of the minors: Delta_k(n.PauxG^-T), k = 1, 2, 3 (symbolic, Factor); kappa^G = Delta1^(l1-l2) Delta2^(l2-l3) Delta3^(l3)\"] = ToString[Table[Factor[Det[(nMat3[symZ, o1, o2] . Transpose[Inverse[PauxG[symZ]]])[[1 ;; k, 1 ;; k]]]], {k, 3}], InputForm];\nkapMinors = Table[Factor[Det[(nMat3[symZ, o1, o2] . Transpose[Inverse[PauxG[symZ]]])[[1 ;; k, 1 ;; k]]]], {k, 3}];\nkapMinorsInf = Table[Factor[Limit[kapMinors[[k]], o2 -> Infinity]], {k, 3}];\nck[\"(c) om2 -> infinity limits of the minors Delta_k (finite? Factor)\"] = ToString[kapMinorsInf, InputForm];\nck[\"(c) kappa^G at om2 = 10^6, 10^9, 10^12 (P, om1 = 5/2) and its predicted limit (Prod Delta_k,inf^(l_k - l_k+1))\"] = {Table[N[kapG[zP, {5/2, 10^k, 3/5}], 12], {k, {6, 9, 12}}], N[Product[kapMinorsInf[[k]]^expL[[k]], {k, 3}] /. Thread[symZ -> zP] /. {o1 -> 5/2}, 12]};\n(* the tie of the limits: OmegaDinf.PphysG parallel to Omega_c^inf = coverG[gaussCinf] (om3 arbitrary) *)\nck[\"(c) tie of the limits: OmegaDinf[zeta, om1].PphysG[zeta] parallel to coverG[gaussCinf(om1, om3)] exactly (P, P'; om1 = 5/2, -2/5; om3 = 3/5, 9/4)\"] = Table[parOf[ΩDinf[zz, w1] . PphysG[zz], coverG[gaussCinf /. {o1 -> w1, o3 -> w3}]], {zz, {zP, zQ}}, {w1, {5/2, -2/5}}, {w3, {3/5, 9/4}}];\nck[\"(c) kappa^G_inf(zeta, om1) = first component of OmegaDinf.PphysG at P (om1 = 5/2, -2/5, 9/7)\"] = Table[(ΩDinf[zP, w1] . PphysG[zP])[[1]], {w1, {5/2, -2/5, 9/7}}];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"check\", \"result\"}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
