n the slice weights used (rank = dim with the 4-point grid) | True |\n| (c) CG-complete on EVERY weight of V (rank = dim with the 4-point grid; with the 6-point grid) | {True, True} |\n| (c) regression: phi_u(grid, 4 points) = coverG[{a', g', c'}] from the closed forms (exact) | True |",
