  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task A4 (K/S). Signal vs contamination on the chain for the (inf,inf) family (om2 = om2' = infinity). For a family point: Phi (200 digits), R_C = <Phi|Psi_B> (Psi_B G-normalised HW-limit branch), S = <Phi|P_HW Psi_B> (G-orthogonal projector onto the HW space of the sector), K = R_C - S, undo check S = <phi_u (x) e1|P_HW Psi_B>. eps-exponents are log2 ratios between consecutive eps (ratio 2). Families (Gaudin: the vacua are eps-free in the main family): main (24 points, zeta = eps phi, omega = eps om, omega' = eps om'), CONTROL omega' = (7/4,-2/5) fixed (not untwisted), common omega1' = omega1, and the main family with phi' (eps = 1e-6). *)\nck = <||>;\nnb = Length[hwListG]; Bs = {B1, B2, B3};\nchainDataG[ie_, ph_] := chainDataG[ie, ph] = Module[{B = branchesG[epsL[[ie]] ph]},\n  Table[With[{b = brOf[B, hwListG[[ib, 1]], hwListG[[ib, 2]]]}, <|\"psi\" -> b[\"psi\"], \"ph\" -> PHWc[b[\"mu\"]][b[\"psi\"]], \"hwFrac\" -> b[\"hwFrac\"]|>], {ib, nb}]];\nfamMain = <|\"name\" -> \"main\", \"pts\" -> Map[{{#[[1]], Infinity}, {#[[2]], Infinity}} &, gridIx], \"om\" -> Function[{ee, om, omp}, {ee om, ee omp}]|>;\nfamFixed = <|\"name\" -> \"fixed\", \"pts\" -> Table[{{o1, Infinity}, {0, Infinity}}, {o1, {3/4, -5/3, 1/2, -7/3}}], \"om\" -> Function[{ee, om, omp}, {ee om, {7/4, Infinity}}]|>;\nfamCommon1 = <|\"name\" -> \"common1\", \"pts\" -> Table[{{o1, Infinity}, {o1, Infinity}}, {o1, {3/4, -5/3, 1/2}}], \"om\" -> Function[{ee, om, omp}, {ee om, ee omp}]|>;\nt4Point[fam_, ph_, ie_, pt_] := Module[{eps = epsL[[ie]], zz = epsL[[ie]] ph, ws, cd = chainDataG[ie, ph], Phi, phe},\n  ws = fam[\"om\"][eps, pt[[1]], pt[[2]]];\n  Phi = kron[N[ΩD[zz, ws[[1]]], pr], N[ΩD[zz, ws[[2]]], pr]]; phe = kron[N[phiUof[zz, ws[[1]], ws[[2]]], pr], e1];\n  Table[With[{d = cd[[ib]]}, With[{RC = Phi . d[\"psi\"], S = Phi . d[\"ph\"], und = phe . d[\"ph\"]}, <|\"RC\" -> RC, \"S\" -> S, \"K\" -> RC - S, \"undo\" -> If[S == 0, 0, Abs[(S - und)/S]]|>]], {ib, nb}]];\nt4Run[fam_, ph_, ies_] := Table[t4Point[fam, ph, ie, pt], {ie, ies}, {pt, fam[\"pts\"]}];\nexpo2[a_, b_] := If[a == 0 || b == 0, Indeterminate, N[Log[Abs[b/a]]/Log[2], 6]];\n{t4one, t4once} = AbsoluteTiming[t4Point[famMain, phiP, 1, famMain[\"pts\"][[1]]]];\nT4 = <||>;\n{tMain, T4[\"main\"]} = AbsoluteTiming[t4Run[famMain, phiP, {1, 2, 3}]];\n{tFix, T4[\"fixed\"]} = AbsoluteTiming[t4Run[famFixed, phiP, {1, 2, 3}]];\n{tCom, T4[\"common1\"]} = AbsoluteTiming[t4Run[famCommon1, phiP, {1, 2, 3}]];\n{tMainC, T4[\"mainC\"]} = AbsoluteTiming[t4Run[famMain, phiC, {1}]];\nfmtE[x_] := If[x == 0, \"0 (acc \" <> ToString[Round[Accuracy[x]]] <> \")\", With[{e = Floor[Log10[Abs[x]]]}, ToString[Round[x/10^e, 0.01]] <> \"e\" <> ToString[e]]];\nbranchRead[Tf_, ib_] := Max[Table[Abs[Tf[[1, ip, ib, \"S\"]]/Tf[[1, ip, ib, \"RC\"]]], {ip, Length[Tf[[1]]]}]] > 10^-100;\nksTab[Tf_, nEps_] := Table[If[! branchRead[Tf, ib], {hwListG[[ib, 1]], hwListG[[ib, 2]], \"not read\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, Module[{np = Length[Tf[[1]]], S, K, eS, eK, mx, flatK0},\n   S = Table[Tf[[ie, ip, ib, \"S\"]], {ie, nEps}, {ip, np}]; K = Table[Tf[[ie, ip, ib, \"K\"]], {ie, nEps}, {ip, np}];\n   mx = Table[Max[Abs[K[[ie]]/S[[ie]]]], {ie, nEps}]; flatK0 = Max[mx] < 10^-120;\n   eS = If[nEps > 1, Table[expo2[S[[ie, ip]], S[[ie + 1, ip]]], {ie, nEps - 1}, {ip, np}], {{0}}];\n   eK = If[flatK0 || nEps < 2, {{0}}, Table[expo2[K[[ie, ip]], K[[ie + 1, ip]]], {ie, nEps - 1}, {ip, np}]];\n   {hwListG[[ib, 1]], hwListG[[ib, 2]], If[nEps > 1, ToString[Round[#, 0.001] & /@ MinMax[Flatten[eS]]], \"-\"], If[flatK0, \"K=0\", If[nEps > 1, ToString[Round[#, 0.001] & /@ MinMax[Flatten[eK]]], \"-\"]], If[flatK0, \"0\", StringRiffle[fmtE /@ mx, \", \"]], If[nEps >= 3 && ! flatK0, ToString[N[mx[[2]]/mx[[1]], 4]] <> \", \" <> ToString[N[mx[[3]]/mx[[2]], 4]], \"-\"], fmtE[Max[Table[Tf[[ie, ip, ib, \"undo\"]], {ie, nEps}, {ip, np}]]]}]], {ib, nb}];\nfamKeys = {\"main\", \"fixed\", \"common1\", \"mainC\"};\nfamNEps = <|\"main\" -> 3, \"fixed\" -> 3, \"common1\" -> 3, \"mainC\" -> 1|>;\nfamLab = <|\"main\" -> \"(inf,inf) MAIN family (6 points, phi)\", \"fixed\" -> \"CONTROL omega1' = 7/4 fixed, omega2 = omega2' = infinity (4 points)\", \"common1\" -> \"CONTROL omega1' = omega1 (3 points; Phi = Omega (x) Omega)\", \"mainC\" -> \"MAIN family with phi' (6 points, eps = 1e-6 only)\"|>;\nksAll = Association[Table[k -> ksTab[T4[k], famNEps[k]], {k, famKeys}]];\nck[\"K/S = O(eps) for every branch of the main family (max|K/S| doubles with eps: ratios in [1.9, 2.1])\"] = And @@ Table[r[[6]] === \"-\" || (And @@ (1.9 < ToExpression[#] < 2.1 & /@ StringSplit[r[[6]], \", \"])), {r, ksAll[\"main\"]}];\nck[\"undo S = <phi_u (x) e1|P_HW Psi> (max rel dev over all families, branches, points)\"] = sz[Max[Table[x[\"undo\"], {k, famKeys}, {x, Flatten[T4[k]]}]]];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"family\", \"mu\", \"copy\", \"S: eps-exp range\", \"K: eps-exp range\", \"max |K/S| at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6\", \"ratios of max|K/S| (O(eps): 2, 2)\", \"max undo rel dev\"}}, Flatten[Table[Join[{{famLab[k], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[{\"\", r[[1]], r[[2]], r[[3]], r[[4]], r[[5]], r[[6]], r[[7]]}, {r, ksAll[k]}]], {k, famKeys}], 1], {{\"main family: K/S = O(eps) for every branch\", ToString[ck[\"K/S = O(eps) for every branch of the main family (max|K/S| doubles with eps: ratios in [1.9, 2.1])\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s): one point, main (72 pts), fixed, common1, phi'\", ToString[N[{t4one, tMain, tFix, tCom, tMainC}, 3], InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[2,1,0] run** (the saved value of the switch):\n\n| family | mu | copy | S: eps-exp range | K: eps-exp range | max \\|K/S\\| at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios of max\\|K/S\\| (O(eps): 2, 2) | max undo rel dev |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| (inf,inf) MAIN family (6 points, phi) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 2, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {4, 1, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.54e-6, 5.09e-6, 1.02e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {3, 3, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.42e-6, 4.83e-6, 9.67e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {3, 2, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 6.64e-7, 1.33e-6, 2.66e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {3, 2, 1} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 2.1e-6, 4.19e-6, 8.39e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {2, 2, 2} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.53e-6, 3.05e-6, 6.1e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 194) |\n| CONTROL omega1' = 7/4 fixed, omega2 = omega2' = infinity (4 points) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 2, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {4, 1, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.07e-6, 2.14e-6, 4.28e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {3, 3, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.04e-6, 2.09e-6, 4.18e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {3, 2, 1} | 1 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 7.9e-7, 1.58e-6, 3.16e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {3, 2, 1} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 5.13e-6, 1.03e-5, 2.05e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 195) |\n|  | {2, 2, 2} | 1 | {1., 1.} | {1., 1.} | 5.17e-1, 5.17e-1, 5.17e-1 | 1.000, 1.000 | 0 (acc 189) |\n| CONTROL omega1' = omega1 (3 points; Phi = Omega (x) Omega) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 2, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {4, 1, 1} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {3, 3, 0} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {3, 2, 1} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {3, 2, 1} | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {2, 2, 2} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| MAIN family with phi' (6 points, eps = 1e-6 only) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 2, 0} | 1 | - | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {4, 1, 1} | 1 | - | - | 3.8e-6 | - | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {3, 3, 0} | 1 | - | - | 2.29e-6 | - | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {3, 2, 1} | 1 | - | - | 7.15e-7 | - | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {3, 2, 1} | 2 | - | - | 5.89e-6 | - | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {2, 2, 2} | 1 | - | - | 1.53e-6 | - | 0 (acc 195) |\n| main family: K/S = O(eps) for every branch | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| time (s): one point, main (72 pts), fixed, common1, phi' | {0.0019825, 0.017378, 0.0109962, 0.0072054, 0.0774085} |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
