 0.} | {1., 1.} | 1.36e-6, 2.71e-6, 5.43e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {4, 3, 1} | 2 | {0., 0.} | {1., 1.} | 8.36e-6, 1.67e-5, 3.34e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | 0 (acc 192) |\n|  | {4, 2, 2} | 1 | {1., 1.} | {1., 1.} | 4.65e-1, 4.65e-1, 4.65e-1 | 1.000, 1.000 | 0 (acc 188) |\n|  | {3, 3, 2} | 1 | {1., 1.} | {1., 1.} | 3.88e-1, 3.88e-1, 3.88e-1 | 1.000, 1.000 | 0 (acc 187) |\n| CONTROL omega1' = omega1 (3 points; Phi = Omega (x) Omega) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 2, 0} | 1 | {0., 0.} | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 1, 1} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 3, 0} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 2, 1} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {5, 2, 1} | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 4, 0} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 3, 1} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 3, 1} | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {4, 2, 2} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {3, 3, 2} | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| MAIN family with phi' (6 points, eps = 1e-6 only) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {6, 2, 0} | 1 | - | K=0 | 0 | - | 0 (acc 199) |\n|  | {6, 1, 1} | 1 | - | - | 3.8e-6 | - | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {5, 3, 0} | 1 | - | - | 1.15e-6 | - | 0 (acc 198) |\n|  | {5, 2, 1} | 1 | - | - | 6.27e-7 | - | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {5, 2, 1} | 2 | - | - | 1.7e-6 | - | 0 (acc 196) |\n|  | {4, 4, 0} | 1 | - | - | 4.59e-6 | - | 0 (acc 197) |\n|  | {4, 3, 1} | 1 | - | - | 2.32e-6 | - | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {4, 3, 1} | 2 | - | - | 1.91e-6 | - | 0 (acc 193) |\n|  | {4, 2, 2} | 1 | - | - | 1.37e-6 | - | 0 (acc 194) |\n|  | {3, 3, 2} | 1 | - | - | 3.28e-6 | - | 0 (acc 193) |\n| main family: K/S = O(eps) for every branch | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| time (s): one point, main (72 pts), fixed, common1, phi' | {0.0085672, 0.043008, 0.0210366, 0.0133162, 0.5962633} |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
