  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task A4 (CG). CG data at leading order from the overlap alone. The HW state B of weight mu has its CG slice at the one-site weight nu = mu - Lambda (site 2 = e1): chain slice c_B(eps) = [P_HW Psi_B] at (GT indices of nu, site-2 index 1). Overlap side: R_C = phi_u . c_B + K, so C := R_C/phi_u[slice] -> c_B as eps -> 0 (1-dim slices); for a 2-dim slice the 2x2 system from two grid points with non-parallel phi_u slices gives the slice vector. Truth = the exact normalised HW kets hwTrue (G-norm 1, same sign convention; for the multiplicity-2 sector the untwisted Gaudin copies of Task 2). Richardson in eps (1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6): R1 = 2 f(e) - f(2e), R2 = (4 R1(e) - R1(2e))/3 removes O(eps^2). *)\nck = <||>;\nrich3[f_] := Module[{r1 = 2 f[[1]] - f[[2]], r2 = 2 f[[2]] - f[[3]]}, (4 r1 - r2)/3];\nphiAt[fam_, ph_, ie_, pt_] := With[{ws = fam[\"om\"][epsL[[ie]], pt[[1]], pt[[2]]], zz = epsL[[ie]] ph}, N[phiUof[zz, ws[[1]], ws[[2]]], pr]];\ncgFamily[key_, fam_, ph_] := Module[{pts = fam[\"pts\"], np, phis, cd},\n  np = Length[pts]; phis = Table[phiAt[fam, ph, ie, pt], {ie, 3}, {pt, pts}];\n  cd = Table[chainDataG[ie, ph], {ie, 3}];\n  Table[Module[{mu = hwListG[[ib, 1]], nu, ix, dm, slC, RC, exact, res, pairs, cs, rows},\n    nu = mu - Λ; ix = idxOf[nu]; dm = Length[ix];\n    slC = Table[cd[[ie, ib, \"ph\"]][[(ix - 1) d1 + 1]], {ie, 3}];\n    exact = hwTrue[hwListG[[ib]]][[(ix - 1) d1 + 1]];\n    RC = Table[T4[key][[ie, ip, ib, \"RC\"]], {ie, 3}, {ip, np}];\n    If[dm == 1,\n      cs = Table[RC[[ie, ip]]/phis[[ie, ip, ix[[1]]]], {ie, 3}, {ip, np}];\n      res = <|\"ib\" -> ib, \"dim\" -> 1, \"spread\" -> Table[Max[Abs[cs[[ie]]/Mean[cs[[ie]]] - 1]], {ie, 3}], \"err\" -> Table[Max[Abs[cs[[ie]]/slC[[ie, 1]] - 1]], {ie, 3}], \"rich\" -> {rich3[cs[[All, 1]]]}, \"richChain\" -> {rich3[slC[[All, 1]]]}, \"exact\" -> exact, \"ps\" -> {1}|>,\n      pairs = Select[Table[{k, k + Floor[np/2]}, {k, Floor[np/2]}], Abs[Det[phis[[1, #, ix]]]] > 10^-3 Max[Abs[phis[[1, #, ix]]]]^2 &];\n      If[pairs === {}, pairs = {{1, 2}}];\n      cs = Table[Table[LinearSolve[phis[[ie, pp, ix]], RC[[ie, pp]]], {pp, pairs}], {ie, 3}];\n      res = <|\"ib\" -> ib, \"dim\" -> dm, \"npairs\" -> Length[pairs], \"spread\" -> Table[Max[Abs[cs[[ie]]/ConstantArray[Mean[cs[[ie]]], Length[pairs]] - 1]], {ie, 3}], \"err\" -> Table[Max[Abs[cs[[ie]]/ConstantArray[slC[[ie]], Length[pairs]] - 1]], {ie, 3}], \"rich\" -> rich3[cs[[All, 1]]], \"richChain\" -> rich3[slC], \"exact\" -> exact, \"cond\" -> Max[Table[Norm[phis[[1, pp, ix]]] Norm[Inverse[phis[[1, pp, ix]]]], {pp, pairs}]]|>];\n    res], {ib, nb}]];\n{tCG, cgMain} = AbsoluteTiming[cgFamily[\"main\", famMain, phiP]];\ncgFix = cgFamily[\"fixed\", famFixed, phiP];\nsignFix[v_, ref_] := If[Norm[v - ref] <= Norm[v + ref], v, -v];\nrowCG[r_] := Module[{ib = r[\"ib\"], lab, ex, ri, rc},\n  lab = hwListG[[ib]]; ex = r[\"exact\"]; ri = If[r[\"dim\"] == 1, r[\"rich\"], r[\"rich\"]]; rc = r[\"richChain\"];\n  {lab[[1]], lab[[2]], r[\"dim\"], StringRiffle[fmtE /@ r[\"spread\"][[{1, 3}]], \", \"], StringRiffle[fmtE /@ r[\"err\"], \", \"], If[r[\"err\"][[1]] == 0, \"-\", ToString[N[r[\"err\"][[3]]/r[\"err\"][[1]], 3]]], ToString[N[ex, 10], InputForm], ToString[N[ri, 10], InputForm], fmtE[Max[Abs[ri - ex]/Max[Abs[ex]]]], fmtE[Max[Abs[rc - ex]/Max[Abs[ex]]]]}];\n(* closed-form regression: phi_u of the (inf,inf) family equals e1 rho(exp(a' E12) exp(g' E13) exp(c' E23)) with the A3 closed forms (checked in A3 at 6 points); the eps -> 0 limit of the control omega1' = 7/4 fixed: exact, symbolic eps *)\nphiLimFixed = Table[Module[{np = Map[Together, nPrime[ep phiP, {ep pt[[1, 1]], Infinity}, {7/4, Infinity}], {2}]}, (Together /@ coverG[{np[[1, 2]], np[[1, 3]] - np[[1, 2]] np[[2, 3]], np[[2, 3]]}]) /. ep -> 0], {pt, famFixed[\"pts\"]}];\nck[\"control omega1' = 7/4 fixed: eps -> 0 limit of phi_u finite and per-weight ranks over 4 directions {weight, dim, rank}\"] = {FreeQ[phiLimFixed, ComplexInfinity | Indeterminate], Table[{u12wts[[m]], u12dims[[m]], MatrixRank[phiLimFixed[[All, u12idx[[m]]]]]}, {m, Length[u12wts]}]};\n(* octet mixing in the multiplicity-2 sector(s) of weight mu: R_c = (u.C_c)/(u'.C_c) with u = e1 E13, u' = e1 E23 E12 as covectors on the one-site space; C_c = the slice vector (embedded in V) of copy c *)\nnuMix = Λ + {-1, 0, 1}; (* the slice weight reached by e1 E13 and e1 E23 E12; other multiplicity-2 slices (e.g. [3,1,0], mu = (4,3,1)) need other functionals and are not given a mixing ratio *)\nuCov = e1 . Normal[Ee[1, 3]]; upCov = e1 . Normal[Ee[2, 3]] . Normal[Ee[1, 2]];\nsuppOf[v_] := Select[Range[d1], v[[#]] =!= 0 &];\nck[\"u = e1 E13 and u' = e1 E23 E12 are supported on the weight Lambda+(-1,0,1) slice: supports vs idxOf[{1,1,1}]\"] = {suppOf[uCov], suppOf[upCov], idxOf[nuMix]};\nmixRow[key_, cgRes_, ib_] := Module[{lab = hwListG[[ib]], ix = idxOf[hwListG[[ib, 1]] - Λ], r = cgRes[[ib]], emb, Rf},\n  emb[v_] := Module[{f = ConstantArray[0, d1]}, f[[ix]] = v; f]; Rf[v_] := (uCov . emb[v])/(upCov . emb[v]);\n  {lab, N[Rf[r[\"exact\"]], 12], N[Rf[r[\"rich\"]], 12], N[Rf[r[\"richChain\"]], 12], fmtE[Rf[r[\"rich\"]]/Rf[r[\"exact\"]] - 1], fmtE[Rf[r[\"richChain\"]]/Rf[r[\"exact\"]] - 1]}];\nmultIbs = Flatten[Position[hwListG, {mu_, c_} /; Length[hwKets[mu]] >= 2 && mu - Λ === Λ + {-1, 0, 1}]];\nmixRows = Table[mixRow[\"main\", cgMain, ib], {ib, multIbs}];\n(* what the main-family overlap alone gives for the multiplicity-2 slice pair: the 2x2 system yields the slice vector of each copy; mixing from 2 independent grid pairs *)\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nhdr = {\"mu\", \"copy\", \"slice dim\", \"spread over grid (eps=1e-6, 4e-6)\", \"|overlap C/chain slice - 1| at 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6\", \"err ratio 4e-6/1e-6 (O(eps): 4)\", \"exact HW-ket slice (G-norm 1)\", \"overlap-extracted, Richardson limit\", \"max rel |extracted - exact|\", \"max rel |chain Richardson - exact|\"};\nGrid[Join[{hdr}, {{\"MAIN family\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, rowCG /@ cgMain, {{\"CONTROL omega' fixed\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, rowCG /@ cgFix, List @@@ Normal[ck], {{\"mixing R_c = (u.C_c)/(u'.C_c): {mu, copy}\", \"exact copy\", \"overlap Richardson\", \"chain Richardson\", \"rel dev overlap\", \"rel dev chain\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[{ToString[r[[1]], InputForm], ToString[r[[2]]], ToString[r[[3]]], ToString[r[[4]]], r[[5]], r[[6]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {r, mixRows}], {{\"time (s) main CG\", N[tCG, 3], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
