  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### C2: spectator factors f(H1), f(S3c[1,2]) (and the site-2 mirrors) as closed forms in (zeta, omega, theta12)\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
