  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task C2. Spectators f(X) = <Omega (x) Omega|X|e1 (x) e1> for the localising X (<Omega (x) Omega|X = v (x) Omega1, v = Phi e1, f = v[[1]] since Omega1[[1]] = 1). Closed forms from the structure: (i) f(H1) = c_H - zeta.Lambda = |Lambda| Sum zeta - zeta.Lambda + k/theta12 (k from C1); (ii) f(H2) = |Lambda| Sum zeta - zeta.Lambda - k/theta12 (site 2, derived from H1 + H2 + W = 2|Lambda| Sum zeta); (iii) <Omega (x) Omega|S3c[1,2] = [Omega1 S3^{1-site}[-2]] (x) Omega1 so f(S3c[1,2]) = (Omega1 . S3^{1-site}[-2])[[1]], a ONE-SITE quantity: computed symbolically in (zeta, om1, om2) (the one-site cdet in x = u - theta with twist diag(zeta), coefficient of x^-2); theta12 enters nowhere. Everything is verified against the exact two-site spectators (64x64 or 225x225, exact rational) at three points and three theta pairs. *)\nck = <||>;\n(* spectral-parameter samples for the Laurent fits that avoid every pole used below (3/7 = u0 would hit theta1 = 3/7) *)\nuSamAlt = {5/13, -7/9, 8/11, 4/9, -5/6, 9/7, 11/3, 7/5, -5/2};\nS3one[g_] := Module[{M = Association[Flatten[Table[{l[i, j] -> g[[i, j]] id1 + Ee[i, j]/x, lp[i, j] -> -Ee[i, j]/x^2, lpp[i, j] -> 2 Ee[i, j]/x^3}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1]]},\n  Total[Table[t[[1]] If[t[[2]] === {}, id1, Dot @@ Map[M[#] &, t[[2]]]], {t, Ssym[3]}]]];\ngSym = DiagonalMatrix[{f1, f2, f3}];\nS3sym = Normal[S3one[gSym]];\nS3dbl = Map[Coefficient[Expand[#], x, -2] &, S3sym, {2}];\nS3sgl = Map[Coefficient[Expand[#], x, -1] &, S3sym, {2}];\nOm1sym = coverG[rGauss[{f1, f2, f3}, o1, o2]];\nfS3 = Factor[(Om1sym . S3dbl)[[1]]];\nck[\"f(S3c[1,2]) = (Omega1 . S3^{1-site}[-2])[[1]], closed form in (zeta = (f1,f2,f3), om1 = o1, om2 = o2) (theta-free)\"] = ToString[fS3, InputForm];\nck[\"does f(S3c[1,2]) depend on om2? on f3?\"] = {! FreeQ[fS3, o2], ! FreeQ[fS3, f3]};\n(* two-site exact spectators: {f, localises?} *)\nspectNum[zz_, ww_, ths_] := Module[{L = Block[{uSam = uSamAlt}, laurent[DiagonalMatrix[zz], ths]], Om1 = ΩD[zz, ww[[1 ;; 2]]], O2, ops},\n  O2 = kron[Om1, Om1];\n  ops = <|\"H1\" -> {1, L[\"Hres\"][[1]]}, \"S3c12\" -> {1, L[\"S3c\"][{1, 2}]}, \"H2\" -> {2, L[\"Hres\"][[2]]}, \"S3c22\" -> {2, L[\"S3c\"][{2, 2}]}|>;\n  Association[KeyValueMap[Function[{nm, p}, With[{Phi = Partition[O2 . p[[2]], d1]}, nm -> If[p[[1]] == 1, {Phi[[1, 1]], Phi === Outer[Times, Phi[[All, 1]], Om1]}, {Phi[[1, 1]], Phi === Outer[Times, Om1, Phi[[1, All]]]}]]], ops]]];\nkC = Total[Λ]^2 - Total[Λ^2];\npredF[zz_, ww_, th12_] := <|\"H1\" -> Total[Λ] Total[zz] - zz . Λ + kC/th12, \"H2\" -> Total[Λ] Total[zz] - zz . Λ - kC/th12, \"S3c12\" -> (fS3 /. Thread[{f1, f2, f3} -> zz] /. {o1 -> ww[[1]], o2 -> ww[[2]]}), \"S3c22\" -> (fS3 /. Thread[{f1, f2, f3} -> zz] /. {o1 -> ww[[1]], o2 -> ww[[2]]})|>;\nspPts = {{zP, wP}, {zQ, wQ}, {{-1, 7/3, 1/2}, {-3/2, 4/5, 7/3}}};\nspThs = {thN, {1/5, -4/9}, {3/7, -1/4}};\nspRes = Flatten[Table[Module[{m = spectNum[p[[1]], p[[2]], th], pr2 = predF[p[[1]], p[[2]], th[[1]] - th[[2]]]}, {p[[1]], th, Association[Table[nm -> {m[nm][[1]], m[nm][[2]], m[nm][[1]] - pr2[nm]}, {nm, {\"H1\", \"S3c12\", \"H2\", \"S3c22\"}}]]}], {p, spPts}, {th, spThs}], 1];\nck[\"exact two-site localisation (v (x) Omega1 / Omega1 (x) u) holds for H1, S3c12 (site 1), H2, S3c22 (site 2), 9 (zeta, theta) combinations\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Values[r[[3]]][[All, 2]], {r, spRes}]];\nck[\"f(H1), f(H2), f(S3c12), f(S3c22) minus the closed forms (exact), 9 combinations: all zero?\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Values[r[[3]]][[All, 3]] === {0, 0, 0, 0}, {r, spRes}]];\nck[\"values f at P, theta = (2/7,-3/5): {f(H1), f(S3c12), f(H2), f(S3c22)}; at P'\"] = {Values[spRes[[1, 3]]][[All, 1]], Values[spRes[[4, 3]]][[All, 1]]};\nck[\"f(S3c12) = f(S3c22) and independent of theta (the three theta at P): \"] = {And @@ Table[spRes[[j, 3]][\"S3c12\"][[1]] === spRes[[j, 3]][\"S3c22\"][[1]], {j, Length[spRes]}], spRes[[1 ;; 3, 3]][[All, \"S3c12\", 1]]};\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"closed form f(H1)\", \"|Lambda| (z1+z2+z3) - zeta.Lambda + \" <> ToString[kC] <> \"/theta12\"}, {\"closed form f(H2)\", \"|Lambda| (z1+z2+z3) - zeta.Lambda - \" <> ToString[kC] <> \"/theta12\"}, {\"closed form f(S3c[1,2]) = f(S3c[2,2])\", ToString[fS3, InputForm]}}, List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
