   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**[2,1,0] run** (the saved value of the switch):\n\n| time (s) | 0.0014577 |\n|---|---|\n| vac S2inf | wa1*wa2 + wa1*wa3 + wa2*wa3 |\n| vac S3inf | wa1*wa2*wa3 |\n| vac H1 | 4/th12s + wa1 + 2*wa2 + 3*wa3 |\n| vac H2 | -4/th12s + wa1 + 2*wa2 + 3*wa3 |\n| vac S2dbl1 | 3 |\n| vac S2dbl2 | 3 |\n| vac b1 | (4*wa3)/th12s + (wa1 + 2*wa2)*wa3 |\n| vac b2 | (-4*wa3)/th12s + (wa1 + 2*wa2)*wa3 |\n| vac a1 | 3*wa3 |\n| vac a2 | 3*wa3 |\n| vac triple1 | 0 |\n| vac triple2 | 0 |\n| e1 (x) e1 is a left eigenvector of S2^{diag om}(u), S3^{diag om}(u): all components except the first vanish (exact, symbolic) | {True, True} |\n| closed forms (symbolic): e2 and e3 of om at u -> infinity | {0, 0} |\n| exact two-site eigenvalues equal the closed forms (and the covector is an eigencovector): {om, all eigen, all equal}, at (P, wP), (P, wpP), (P', wQ), (P', wP) | {{{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, True, True}, {{7/4, -2/5, 9/7}, True, True}, {{3, -1/3, 7/2}, True, True}, {{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, True, True}} |\n| round-1 numbers at P, om = wP: H1 = 12539/930, H2 = 4139/930, a_s = 9/5, b1 = 2173/310, b2 = 493/310, e2 = 131/15, e3 = 7/2 (closed forms evaluated); only for [2,1,0] | {12539/930, 4139/930, 9/5, 9/5, 2173/310, 493/310, 131/15, 7/2} |",
