  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### C4: universality of the untwisted-copy matrix S3c[1,2]|_HW on the multiplicity-2 sectors (theta-dependence) and the mixing ratios\n",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task C4. The untwisted model (g = 0) has no zeta, so the HW-space matrix of S3c[1,2] depends on theta only. For every multiplicity-2 HW sector mu: the exact 2x2 matrix M(theta) of S3c[1,2] (coordinates in the exact HW kets hwKets[mu]) at theta = (2/7,-3/5), (1/5,-4/9), (3/7,-1/4) (Laurent fits with sample points that avoid the poles: uSamAlt); test (i) M(theta) = a(theta) N0 + s(theta) 1 with a FIXED matrix N0 (traceless parts proportional) = universality of the eigenvectors, (ii) for [3,2,1] the form (3/(2 theta12)) [[3,-1],[-1,7]] + s 1, (iii) the mixing as the ratio r = c2/c1 of the two HW-ket coordinates of each eigen-copy (quadratic M12 r^2 + (M11 - M22) r - M21 = 0), compared with the true copies (eigenvectors of S2(u) + Pi S3(u') on the HW space) at each theta. *)\nck = <||>;\nuSamAlt = {5/13, -7/9, 8/11, 4/9, -5/6, 9/7, 11/3, 7/5, -5/2};\nthsC4 = {thN, {1/5, -4/9}, {3/7, -1/4}};\ng0m = ConstantArray[0, {3, 3}];\ns3c12At[ths_] := Block[{uSam = uSamAlt}, laurent[g0m, ths][\"S3c\"][{1, 2}]];\nckRatio[M_] := Solve[M[[1, 2]] r^2 + (M[[1, 1]] - M[[2, 2]]) r - M[[2, 1]] == 0, r];\ncopiesRatio[ths_, mu_] := Module[{A2 = Sk[2][g0m, ths, 5/13], A3 = Sk[3][g0m, ths, -7/9], Mm, es},\n  Mm = N[hwMat[A2, mu], 60] + N[Pi, 60] N[hwMat[A3, mu], 60]; es = Eigensystem[Mm];\n  SortBy[Table[{es[[1, k]], es[[2, k, 2]]/es[[2, k, 1]]}, {k, 2}], First]];\nc4Rows = Flatten[Table[Module[{Ms = Table[hwMat[s3c12At[ths], mu], {ths, thsC4}], T, T0, th12s3, tl, rowsMu},\n    tl = Table[M - (Tr[M]/2) IdentityMatrix[2], {M, Ms}]; T0 = tl[[1]];\n    rowsMu = Table[Module[{M = Ms[[j]], th12v = thsC4[[j, 1]] - thsC4[[j, 2]], rts, cr},\n      rts = r /. ckRatio[M]; cr = copiesRatio[thsC4[[j]], mu];\n      {mu, thsC4[[j]], th12v, M, With[{rho = If[T0[[1, 2]] =!= 0, tl[[j, 1, 2]]/T0[[1, 2]], tl[[j, 1, 1]]/T0[[1, 1]]]}, tl[[j]] === rho T0], N[rts, 15], N[SortBy[cr[[All, 2]], Identity], 15], N[SortBy[rts, N], 15]}], {j, 3}];\n    rowsMu], {mu, multSecs}], 1];\nck[\"traceless part of M(theta) proportional to that at the base theta (universal eigenvectors), every multiplicity-2 sector, 3 theta\"] = And @@ (#[[5]] & /@ c4Rows);\nck[\"multiplicity-2 sectors in this representation\"] = multSecs;\nck[\"true copies at g = 0 (eigenvectors of S2 + Pi S3 on the HW space at each theta): ratio c2/c1 equals the roots of the S3c[1,2] quadratic (sorted), max abs difference\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[r[[7]] - r[[8]]]], {r, c4Rows}]];\n(* [3,2,1] pattern (adjoint only) *)\nck[\"[3,2,1] in [2,1,0]: M(theta) - (3/(2 theta12)) [[3,-1],[-1,7]] = s 1 (scalar)? {theta, s}\"] = If[Λ === {2, 1, 0}, Table[With[{Mx = r[[4]] - 3/(2 r[[3]]) {{3, -1}, {-1, 7}}}, {r[[2]], Mx[[1, 2]] === 0 && Mx[[2, 1]] === 0 && Mx[[1, 1]] === Mx[[2, 2]], Mx[[1, 1]]}], {r, c4Rows}], \"n/a\"];\nchecks = Join[checks, ck];\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\", \"theta\", \"theta12\", \"M(theta) = matrix of S3c[1,2] (g=0) on HW kets\", \"traceless part prop. to base?\", \"roots r = c2/c1 of M12 r^2 + (M11-M22) r - M21 = 0\", \"true-copy ratios (sorted)\", \"S3c roots (sorted)\"}}, Table[{ToString[r[[1]]], ToString[r[[2]], InputForm], r[[3]], ToString[r[[4]], InputForm], r[[5]], ToString[r[[6]], InputForm], ToString[r[[7]], InputForm], ToString[r[[8]], InputForm]}, {r, c4Rows}], List @@@ Normal[ck]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
