   "value": "**[2,1,0] run** (the saved value of the switch):\n\n| mu | theta | theta12 | M(theta) = matrix of S3c[1,2] (g=0) on HW kets | traceless part prop. to base? | roots r = c2/c1 of M12 r^2 + (M11-M22) r - M21 = 0 | true-copy ratios (sorted) | S3c roots (sorted) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| {3, 2, 1} | {2/7, -3/5} | 31/35 | {{315/62, -105/62}, {-105/62, 735/62}} | True | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} |\n| {3, 2, 1} | {1/5, -4/9} | 29/45 | {{405/58, -135/58}, {-135/58, 945/58}} | True | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} |\n| {3, 2, 1} | {3/7, -1/4} | 19/28 | {{126/19, -42/19}, {-42/19, 294/19}} | True | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} | {-4.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15., 0.23606797749978969640917366873127623544`15.} |\n| traceless part of M(theta) proportional to that at the base theta (universal eigenvectors), every multiplicity-2 sector, 3 theta | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| multiplicity-2 sectors in this representation | {{3, 2, 1}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| true copies at g = 0 (eigenvectors of S2 + Pi S3 on the HW space at each theta): ratio c2/c1 equals the roots of the S3c[1,2] quadratic (sorted), max abs difference | 0``14.07200708358608 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| [3,2,1] in [2,1,0]: M(theta) - (3/(2 theta12)) [[3,-1],[-1,7]] = s 1 (scalar)? {theta, s} | {{{2/7, -3/5}, True, 0}, {{