   "value": "**[3,1,0] run** (same code, first cell switched to `Λ = {3, 1, 0}`):\n\n| mu | theta | theta12 | M(theta) = matrix of S3c[1,2] (g=0) on HW kets | traceless part prop. to base? | roots r = c2/c1 of M12 r^2 + (M11-M22) r - M21 = 0 | true-copy ratios (sorted) | S3c roots (sorted) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| {5, 2, 1} | {2/7, -3/5} | 31/35 | {{665/93, -1400/93}, {-70/93, 1540/93}} | True | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944962`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944965`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944962`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} |\n| {5, 2, 1} | {1/5, -4/9} | 29/45 | {{285/29, -600/29}, {-30/29, 660/29}} | True | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944962`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944965`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944962`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} |\n| {5, 2, 1} | {3/7, -1/4} | 19/28 | {{28/3, -1120/57}, {-56/57, 1232/57}} | True | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944962`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944965`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} | {-0.69676065372348493937078895051953944962`15., 0.07176065372348493937078895051953944965`15.} |\n| {4, 3, 1} | {2/7, -3/5} | 31/35 | {{560/93, -140/93}, {-280/93, 1960/93}} | True | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} |\n| {4, 3, 1} | {1/5, -4/9} | 29/45 | {{240/29, -60/29}, {-120/29, 840/29}} | True | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} |\n| {4, 3, 1} | {3/7, -1/4} | 19/28 | {{448/57, -112/57}, {-224/57, 1568/57}} | True | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} | {-10.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15., 0.19615242270663188058233902451761710083`15.} |\n| traceless part of M(theta) proportional to that at the base theta (universal eigenvectors), every multiplicity-2 sector, 3 theta | True |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| multiplicity-2 sectors in this representation | {{5, 2, 1}, {4, 3, 1}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| true copies at g = 0 (eigenvectors of S2 + Pi S3 on the HW space at each theta): ratio c2/c1 equals the roots of the S3c[1,2] quadratic (sorted), max abs difference | 0``13.690533685203988 |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| [3,2,1] in [2,1,0]: M(theta) - (3/(2 theta12)) [[3,-1],[-1,7]] = s 1 (scalar)? {theta, s} | n/a |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
